{"version":1,"key":"card:448","content":{"id":448,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"3ed83612-3edb-4fa2-958c-7fa39d5d471d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"解包是指将一个序列（或任何可迭代对象）值存储到一系列变量中。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"py","uuid":"09844b35-7e5e-490a-85e3-6e63455107cf","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"76dfc870-ebd1-4fba-a65d-f558e46f5fa1","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":">>> x, y, z = 1, 2, 3\n>>> print(x, y, z)\n1 2 3","collabId":"be965d70-2a2b-4167-ac06-55c578cfd717","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"py","uuid":"b821c242-83ad-438f-88fc-0c9c161157b6","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"d563d19b-afc9-41db-9bbc-6336905d6efa","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":">>> values = 1, 2, 3\n>>> values\n(1, 2, 3)\n>>> x, y, z = values\n>>> x\n1","collabId":"284f0bae-210f-4cc4-9e70-7691a7bd00d6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"warning","title":"","tauContract":"82a3e58fc7df817d12ed2ff5fb675ef0d468689701d99d9471018c2dbd8a3221","collabId":"a99078a3-9e47-4c29-9594-9bcbcf5d8f36","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"2a7a572e-3aff-4548-9d1c-18ef00645958","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"要解包的序列包含的元素个数必须与你在等号左边列出的目标个数相同，否则 Python 将引发异常。"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"750ac5ea-a41f-491c-9c01-2ee1a47b14f1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"可使用星号运算符（*）来收集多余的值，这样无需确保值和变量的个数相同"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"py","uuid":"ce7aebd4-279c-408d-a4d2-fb3b8851f164","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"d7d53b8a-a17b-4009-bf8d-491baf91699c","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":">>> a, b, *rest = [1, 2, 3, 4]\n>>> rest\n[3, 4]","collabId":"f8c3844f-c7e4-4d06-9815-6e55961c6145","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"py","uuid":"2925cc48-7f59-49e0-ad32-ff29859b0066","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"c94f89b6-86e8-400a-a721-993002aba4ba","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":">>> name = \"Albus Percival Wulfric Brian Dumbledore\"\n>>> first, *middle, last = name.split()\n>>> middle\n['Percival', 'Wulfric', 'Brian']","collabId":"4aa82851-8cc9-4fc7-b386-34c7a43e07d8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}],"tags":["Python/解包"],"createTime":1719156126391,"updateTime":1743303640440,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1743303640440}}